            <h3 class="doc-h doc-h-section doc-h-spec" id="sheet-27-spec-1" style="--lv:0"><span class="spec-badge">機能仕様</span><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0204" data-excel-sheet="タグ登録" data-excel-ref="0204:タグ登録!B56">機能について</span></h3>
