            <div class="doc-bullet" style="--lv:1"><span class="doc-marker"><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0204" data-excel-sheet="タグ登録" data-excel-ref="0204:タグ登録!C72">★</span></span><span><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0204" data-excel-sheet="タグ登録" data-excel-ref="0204:タグ登録!D72">タグデータの精査を実施する</span></span></div>
            <h3 class="doc-h doc-h-section doc-h-spec" id="sheet-27-spec-3" style="--lv:0"><span class="spec-badge">機能仕様</span><span class="src-cell" data-excel-book="0204" data-excel-sheet="タグ登録" data-excel-ref="0204:タグ登録!B74">処理概要</span></h3>
